    "body": "## Problem\n\nDescribe the problem (concisely).\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n```sh\nnvim --clean +'lua vim._with({ buf = 0, _ = \"\", win = 0 }, print)'\n```\n```\n(gdb) bt\n#0  0x00007fab9ee9a11c in ?? () from /usr/lib/libc.so.6\n#1  0x00007fab9ee3e5d0 in raise () from /usr/lib/libc.so.6\n#2  0x00007fab9ee25685 in abort () from /usr/lib/libc.so.6\n#3  0x00007fab9ee26704 in ?? () from /usr/lib/libc.so.6\n#4  0x00007fab9ee361f2 in __assert_fail () from /usr/lib/libc.so.6\n#5  0x000055c4a58a8896 in ctx_switch (cs=0x7fffed287390, wp=0x55c4aab61a80, tp=0x55c4aab684a0, buf=0x55c4aab64890, flags=<optimized out>)\n    at src/nvim/context.c:640\n#6  0x000055c4a5aa29f6 in nlua_with (L=0x7fab9ec41380) at src/nvim/lua/stdlib.c:648\n#7  0x000055c4a5cfbc3a in lj_BC_FUNCC ()\n#8  0x000055c4a5ce4f1a in lua_pcall (L=L@entry=0x7fab9ec41380, nargs=nargs@entry=0, nresults=nresults@entry=0, errfunc=errfunc@entry=-2) at lj_api.c:1135\n#9  0x000055c4a5a954a8 in nlua_pcall (lstate=lstate@entry=0x7fab9ec41380, nargs=nargs@entry=0, nresults=nresults@entry=0)\n    at src/nvim/lua/executor.c:345\n#10 0x000055c4a5a9a6de in nlua_exec_typval (lcmd=<optimized out>, lcmd_len=<optimized out>, name=<optimized out>, args=<optimized out>, argcount=0, special=false, \n    ret_tv=0x0) at src/nvim/lua/executor.c:1654\n#11 0x000055c4a5a9c2a8 in nlua_exec_typval (lcmd=0x55c4aabbdda0 \"vim._with({ buf = 0, [1] = \\\"\\\", win = 0 }, print)\", lcmd_len=<optimized out>, \n    name=0x55c4a5ddf6d2 \":lua\", args=0x0, argcount=0, special=false, ret_tv=0x0) at src/nvim/lua/executor.c:1639\n#12 ex_lua (eap=<optimized out>) at src/nvim/lua/executor.c:1962\n#13 0x000055c4a59df154 in execute_cmd0 (retv=retv@entry=0x7fffed287774, eap=eap@entry=0x7fffed287810, errormsg=errormsg@entry=0x7fffed287788, \n    preview=preview@entry=false) at src/nvim/ex_docmd.c:1738\n#14 0x000055c4a59e25c2 in do_one_cmd (cmdlinep=0x7fffed287780, flags=11, cstack=0x7fffed2878e0, fgetline=0x0, cookie=0x0)\n    at src/nvim/ex_docmd.c:2364\n#15 do_cmdline (cmdline=<optimized out>, fgetline=<optimized out>, cookie=0x0, flags=11) at src/nvim/ex_docmd.c:620\n#16 0x000055c4a58b4ddf in do_cmdline_cmd (cmd=0x7fffed289d99 \"lua vim._with({ buf = 0, [1] = \\\"\\\", win = 0 }, print)\") at src/nvim/ex_docmd.c:318\n#17 exe_commands (parmp=0x7fffed287f40) at src/nvim/main.c:2030\n#18 main (argc=<optimized out>, argv=<optimized out>) at src/nvim/main.c:610\n```\n## Expected behavior\nno crash (ignore unkown key in ctx or throw error)\n\n## System info\n\n- Nvim version (nvim -v): `v0.13.0-dev-1808 g561857c4a8` neovim/neovim@561857c4a8\n- Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?: ?\n- Operating system/version: Linux 7.2.6-zen2-1-zen\n- Terminal name/version: kitty\n- $TERM environment variable: `xterm-kitty`\n- Installation: ?\n\n",
